<% layout("/layout", { title: "Where / how", appNav: "full" }) %>
<script type="module" src="<%= asset("/js/near-you-switch.js") %>"></script>
<%/* Settings-style cards: "Near you" on this device, then the where/hows on the map and the rest (partials/places-list),
     with a sheet each for adding a spot (partials/place-sheets; "I'm here now" is <here-button>, in near-you-switch.js). */%>
<div class="settings-page places-page">
<a class="back" href="<%= it.chrome?.back.href ?? '/' %>">← <%= it.chrome?.back.label ?? 'All tasks' %></a>
<h1>Where / how</h1>
<p class="hint">Where or how a task gets done: a shop like <code>@Target</code>, or a way like <code>@phone</code>. Type @ and a name in a task to add one. Give the ones that are real places a spot on the map (a shop with several branches can have one for each), and Task Sloth can tell you when you're near one.</p>
<%~ include("/partials/flash", it.flash ?? {}) %>

<div class="settings">
  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="near-title">
    <h2 id="near-title"><span class="emoji" aria-hidden="true">📍</span> Near you</h2>
    <p>When this phone is near one of your places, the app says what there is to do there and moves it to the top of your list grouped by Where / how. If you allow notifications, you also get one when the app is open but not on screen.</p>
    <p class="hint">It only checks while the app is open. That checking happens on this phone: where you are isn't sent to us or saved. (“I'm here now” below is different: it saves where you're standing as a spot.)</p>
    <%/* <near-you-switch> shows whether it's on for this device (localStorage) and asks for the permissions. */%>
    <near-you-switch>
      <p class="hint" data-state="no-script">Needs JavaScript and a phone or browser that can share its location.</p>
      <button type="button" class="button primary" data-action="on" hidden>Turn on for this phone</button>
      <p class="near-on" data-state="on" hidden><strong>On for this phone.</strong> <button type="button" class="link" data-action="off">Turn off</button></p>
      <p class="hint" role="status" data-status></p>
    </near-you-switch>
  </section>

  <% if (it.focusPlaces?.length) { %>
    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
      <h2 id="focus-title"><span class="emoji" aria-hidden="true">🎯</span> Focus on one</h2>
      <p class="hint">Work through a place's tasks one at a time: yours, and any nobody's taken yet. The number is how many you can take on.</p>
      <%~ include("/partials/focus-picker", { contexts: it.focusPlaces }) %>
    </section>
  <% } %>
</div>
<%~ include("/partials/places-list", it) %>
</div>
<%~ include("/partials/place-sheets", it) %>
